WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.212
Welcome to Module 3. This module is about functions and code organization.

00:00:05.212 --> 00:00:12.537
Functions let us give a name to a reusable analytical task instead of copying the same logic again

00:00:12.537 --> 00:00:16.752
and again. That makes code easier to test, explain, and maintain.

00:00:16.752 --> 00:00:20.232
A function gives a reusable task a clear name.

00:00:20.232 --> 00:00:28.314
In analytics, functions are useful for cleaning, validation, scoring, calculation, and reporting logic.
